//! there is no hand-retyped hex anywhere below.
//!
//! The first 3 `count`s (0, 1, 2) of each parameter set's `.rsp` are
//! pinned here -- enough for byte-exact confidence without bloating
//! this repo with the full 100-vector file per parameter set (the
