//! bytes) is the exact input the reference's `main_kat.c` harness feeds
//! to `prng_init(seed, NULL, 48, 0)` before calling
//! `crypto_kem_keypair`/`crypto_kem_enc`/`crypto_kem_dec` -- see
//! kem_kat_test.zig for how this module reproduces that exactly with
//! `prng.Prng`.

